[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba-lang/crm west manifest registration" "unbreaking cloud-itonami-isic-5820 :local/root sibling dependency"], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-crm-west-registration", :adr/related ["cloud-itonami-isic-5820" "adr-2607172600" "adr-2607022900"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607172500-kotoba-lang-crm-west-registration", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-17", :adr/body "# ADR-2607172500: register kotoba-lang/crm (CRM technical commons) into west manifest\n\n**Status**: accepted\n**Date**: 2026-07-17\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki (agent-executed, standing authorization per skill new-project-scaffold)\n**Related**: ADR-2607172600 (isic-5820 Salesforce-replace flagship promotion, same session), CLAUDE.md 2026-07-12 fork-incident note\n\n## Context\n\n`github.com/kotoba-lang/crm` (public, pushed 2026-07-12) is the portable `.cljc` technical\ncommons for the cloud-itonami CRM/subscription-commerce actor fleet: `kotoba.crm.pipeline`\n(stage-transition validator), `kotoba.crm.revrec` (ASC 606/IFRS 15 straight-line recompute),\n`kotoba.crm.funnel` (pipeline funnel/conversion analytics, HEAD a648f40). It is consumed by\n`cloud-itonami-isic-5820` via `deps.edn` `{:local/root \"../../kotoba-lang/crm\"}` and named as\nshared commons by the 6201/6202/6209 sibling actors -- yet it was never registered in\n`manifest/repos.edn` / `manifest/west.yml`. Consequence: a fresh `west update` checkout cannot\nbuild isic-5820 at all (dangling `:local/root`). The library originated in the 2026-07-12\nfork-overreach incident (CLAUDE.md, Agent-delegation section); the code itself was subsequently\nkept and published on GitHub, but the registration step was never done.\n\n## Decision\n\n- `manifest/repos.edn` `:extra-projects` += `orgs/kotoba-lang/crm` (append at vector tail,\n  same mechanism as the pricing-oracle registration `2aebc1dff641`).\n- `manifest/west.yml` single-entry generation: `nbb scripts/gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry crm`.\n  Pin `a648f40c5c272e9bfba79f6b1407bb43f7402d16` server-verified: exists upstream, reachable\n  from `main` (verify-west-pins OK, new entry so no prior-pin regression check applies).\n- No `.md` twin -- EDN-only per ADR-2607171600.\n\n## Consequences\n\n- `cloud-itonami-isic-5820` builds from a fresh west checkout; the `:local/root` sibling dep\n  resolves. Unblocks the Salesforce-replace flagship promotion (ADR-2607172600).\n- kotoba-lang org default visibility (public) already matched the existing repo -- no\n  visibility change was made (repo predates this ADR).\n", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-17", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607172500: register kotoba-lang/crm (CRM technical commons) into west manifest", :adr/source-format "edn"}]